SF0131 Charter school leasing.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Driskill, Brennan, Dockstader, Hutchings,
Olsen and Salazar and Representative(s) Bear and
Neiman
AN ACT relating to K-12 school facilities; repealing the requirement for charter
schools to receive reimbursement for leasing expenses if the state construction
department determines there are no existing adequate educational facilities
within the school district; making conforming amendments; and providing for an
effective date.
